+.. _cli-config:
+Config
+------
+
+The :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command shows the configuration currently loaded
+into the application. Sensitive keys, such as those containing "SECRET", "PASSWORD",
+"TOKEN", or "KEY" are masked with "***".
+
+.. code-block:: console
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "ENV": "production",
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      ...
+    }
+
+
 Custom Commands
 ---------------
 
